      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5409008750893734809\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F86.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏆\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e We’ve distributed \u003cb\u003e$75,000\u003c/b\u003e among the best designers who imagined a new way to communicate — Telegram Nodes (\u003ca href=\"https://t.me/contest/449\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003esee here\u003c/a\u003e).\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5465602641599930340\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29A96.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e⚖\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e I joined the judging process and spent 10+ hours reviewing thousands of designs from nearly 200 participants. Great work! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5471921242866981303\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918F.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e👏\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5253767677670862169\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F949C.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🔜\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e We’ve now invited the 19 winners to \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/contest/451\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003esuggest improvements\u003c/a\u003e to existing Telegram features. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5435957248314579621\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E2AD90.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e⭐️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e We’re looking for people who — like us — have a burning desire to make Telegram better every day, with no exceptions.",
